                <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;Overdrive | AWS Architecture&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Customer sign-in, grounded text and photo assistance (two AgentCore agents), tickets, stream-driven alerts, customer emails and the diagnostics workflow, daily backups and advisor analytics. Grey dashed parts are defined in code but not activated. Matches the repository templates and code, 2026-11-10.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;spacing=4;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=20;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
